---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn more about Lea and the story behind Life with Lea.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-8">About Me</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Lea! Welcome to <strong>Life with Lea</strong> — a space where I share my favorite recipes,
        thoughts on everyday life, videos, and courses to help you live a little more intentionally.
      </p>

      <p>
        I believe that the best things in life are simple: good food shared with people you love,
        quiet moments of reflection, and the courage to keep growing. This website is my way of
        putting that belief into action.
      </p>

      <h2>What You'll Find Here</h2>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Recipes</strong> — From quick weeknight dinners to weekend baking projects, all tested in my own kitchen.</li>
        <li><strong>Thoughts on Life</strong> — Reflections on the everyday moments that make life beautiful.</li>
        <li><strong>Videos</strong> — Watch along as I cook, create, and share my world.</li>
        <li><strong>Courses</strong> — Learn at your own pace with free and premium courses on topics I'm passionate about.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Let's Connect</h2>

      <p>
        I'd love to hear from you! Whether you have a question, a recipe request, or just want to say hi,
        feel free to reach out at <a href="mailto:hello@life-with-lea.com">hello@life-with-lea.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
